 When continue_deployment is offered, the model may instead request one serial independent successor under the same original source, target, application, persistent bindings and remaining goal allowance. The predecessor still ends FAILED; the successor needs fresh source READs, a fresh plan and independent exact approval. External database initialization, seeds or secrets have no inherited authorization. Submission or custody uncertainty leaves a permanent blocked ticket; restarting does not replay it. Choose the response to the observed failure yourself without treating prior plans or review advice as a deployment answer.
